  keywords        = {Adolescent; Adult; Aged; Aged, 80 and over; Child; Child, Preschool; Denmark, epidemiology; Humans; Incidence; Infant; Inflammatory Bowel Diseases, mortality; Male; Middle Aged; Survival Analysis; Young Adult},
